{
    "title": "Noom Vibe: Pedometer & Advice",
    "description": "A new experience from Noom:\r\n\r\nYou must do 5 things to live better longer: stay active, eat right, sleep well, think positively, and make meaningful connections. Doing these things, day in and day out, means more time with friends, more time with children (and grandchildren), and more time to laugh and love.\r\n\r\nBut actually doing these things can be so hard for so many of us.\r\n\r\nThat\u2019s where Noom Vibe comes in. Noom Vibe is a free app that makes it FUN and REWARDING to build healthy habits. Track your steps, connect with like-minded people, and earn rewards along the way. With a holistic focus on all aspects of wellness, we are here to help you live better. \r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n\r\nRewarded Step Tracker: \r\nGet paid for walking! It\u2019s easy: \r\n1) Download Noom Vibe for free\r\n2) Track your daily steps with our step counter and activity tracker\r\n3) Walk and earn in app currency, called Vibes, for each step you track\r\n4) Bank your Vibes. Get bonus Vibes for daily streaks and meeting your step goal\r\n5) Trade your Vibes in for rewards. Or if you\u2019re feeling generous, donate your Vibes to support amazing causes and help us better the world! \r\n\r\nRewarded Healthy Habit Tracker: \r\nEarn rewards for tracking healthy habits like drinking water, stretching, sleep and meditation. Each habit is categorized to help you easily keep track of whether you\u2019re staying active, eating right, sleeping well or connecting with people in a meaningful way. You\u2019ve got this! \r\n\r\nRewarded Workouts and Meditations: \r\nWith 1000+ on-demand videos, you can earn rewards for each minute you spend exercising or meditating. Healthy habit building categories include low impact, strength training, HIIT, mobility, meditation and more!    \r\n\r\nCommunity & Expert Voices:\r\nEngage with live podcasts hosted by Noom wellness coaches, leading voices and other experts as they share advice on living their best life. Gain invaluable insights and get the support you need on your journey towards a healthier, happier life. \r\n\r\nAt Noom, our mission is to unlock 100 million additional healthy years for people like you over the next decade. It all starts with you having more time to be you. \r\n\r\nDownload Noom Vibe for free today \u2014 your future self will thank you.",
    "descriptionHTML": "A new experience from Noom:<br><br>You must do 5 things to live better longer: stay active, eat right, sleep well, think positively, and make meaningful connections. Doing these things, day in and day out, means more time with friends, more time with children (and grandchildren), and more time to laugh and love.<br><br>But actually doing these things can be so hard for so many of us.<br><br>That\u2019s where Noom Vibe comes in. Noom Vibe is a free app that makes it FUN and REWARDING to build healthy habits. Track your steps, connect with like-minded people, and earn rewards along the way. With a holistic focus on all aspects of wellness, we are here to help you live better. <br><br>FEATURES<br><br>Rewarded Step Tracker: <br>Get paid for walking! It\u2019s easy: <br>1) Download Noom Vibe for free<br>2) Track your daily steps with our step counter and activity tracker<br>3) Walk and earn in app currency, called Vibes, for each step you track<br>4) Bank your Vibes. Get bonus Vibes for daily streaks and meeting your step goal<br>5) Trade your Vibes in for rewards. Or if you\u2019re feeling generous, donate your Vibes to support amazing causes and help us better the world! <br><br>Rewarded Healthy Habit Tracker: <br>Earn rewards for tracking healthy habits like drinking water, stretching, sleep and meditation. Each habit is categorized to help you easily keep track of whether you\u2019re staying active, eating right, sleeping well or connecting with people in a meaningful way. You\u2019ve got this! <br><br>Rewarded Workouts and Meditations: <br>With 1000+ on-demand videos, you can earn rewards for each minute you spend exercising or meditating. Healthy habit building categories include low impact, strength training, HIIT, mobility, meditation and more!    <br><br>Community &amp; Expert Voices:<br>Engage with live podcasts hosted by Noom wellness coaches, leading voices and other experts as they share advice on living their best life. Gain invaluable insights and get the support you need on your journey towards a healthier, happier life. <br><br>At Noom, our mission is to unlock 100 million additional healthy years for people like you over the next decade. It all starts with you having more time to be you. <br><br>Download Noom Vibe for free today \u2014 your future self will thank you.",
